  - `packages/hobo-ci/src/onepassword-access.ts:225-227` — Arbitrary existing tokens receive a synthetic 24-hour `expiresAt`. Reuse can outlive the token’s real expiration and cause delayed CI failures. Base reuse on verified expiry or revalidate before reuse.

  **P2**: none

